[
  {"id":"classic-01","text":"长风破浪会有时，直挂云帆济沧海。","attribution":"李白《行路难·其一》","category":"persistence","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-02","text":"会当凌绝顶，一览众山小。","attribution":"杜甫《望岳》","category":"persistence","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-03","text":"欲穷千里目，更上一层楼。","attribution":"王之涣《登鹳雀楼》","category":"persistence","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-04","text":"纸上得来终觉浅，绝知此事要躬行。","attribution":"陆游《冬夜读书示子聿》","category":"reading","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-05","text":"古人学问无遗力，少壮工夫老始成。","attribution":"陆游《冬夜读书示子聿》","category":"reading","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-06","text":"山重水复疑无路，柳暗花明又一村。","attribution":"陆游《游山西村》","category":"landscape","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-07","text":"千磨万击还坚劲，任尔东西南北风。","attribution":"郑燮《竹石》","category":"persistence","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-08","text":"不畏浮云遮望眼，自缘身在最高层。","attribution":"王安石《登飞来峰》","category":"persistence","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-09","text":"沉舟侧畔千帆过，病树前头万木春。","attribution":"刘禹锡《酬乐天扬州初逢席上见赠》","category":"landscape","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-10","text":"读书不觉已春深，一寸光阴一寸金。","attribution":"王贞白《白鹿洞二首·其一》","category":"reading","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-11","text":"博观而约取，厚积而薄发。","attribution":"苏轼《稼说送张琥》","category":"reading","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"classic-12","text":"知不足，然后能自反也；知困，然后能自强也。","attribution":"《礼记·学记》","category":"selfEncouragement","sourceType":"classical"},
  {"id":"original-01","text":"不用一下子抵达很远，先把眼前这一页认真读完。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"reading","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-02","text":"今天留下的每一分钟，都会慢慢成为你的底气。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"persistence","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-03","text":"允许自己走得慢一点，只要仍然在向前。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"selfEncouragement","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-04","text":"安静地积累，时间会替你把答案写出来。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"composure","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-05","text":"先完成这一小段，远方会一点点变近。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"persistence","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-06","text":"你不需要时刻满格，认真出现就已经很好。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"selfEncouragement","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-07","text":"把心放在这一页上，其他的事先轻轻放下。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"composure","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-08","text":"清晨不必匆忙，先给自己一段完整的安静。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"morning","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-09","text":"读不进去的时候，先坐一会儿也算开始。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"reading","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-10","text":"今天的风有一点轻，适合把知识慢慢放进心里。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"morning","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-11","text":"做完这一题，给自己一点不张扬的肯定。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"selfEncouragement","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-12","text":"不用和谁比较，你正在写自己的那一页。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"composure","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-13","text":"一笔一画地学，日子会记得你的认真。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"reading","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-14","text":"如果今天很累，就把目标缩小到下一页。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"selfEncouragement","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-15","text":"把难题留在桌上，不必把它带进心里。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"composure","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-16","text":"山路很长，但脚下这一小步是真实的。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"landscape","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-17","text":"你可以停下来喝口水，再回到书页之间。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"selfEncouragement","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-18","text":"把手机放远一点，把心收回来一点。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"composure","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-19","text":"这一页不会自己翻过去，但你会。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"persistence","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-20","text":"早一点坐到桌前，就是给今天的温柔交代。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"morning","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-21","text":"懂得慢慢来的人，也懂得把路走长。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"landscape","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-22","text":"知识不会催你，它只等你一次次靠近。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"reading","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-23","text":"给这一段时间一个名字：我在认真生活。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"selfEncouragement","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-24","text":"不急着证明什么，先把手边的事做好。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"composure","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-25","text":"日历上的一点绿色，是你和时间悄悄握手。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"persistence","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-26","text":"清晨的书页还很新，你也可以重新开始。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"morning","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-27","text":"难的部分可以慢一点，放弃不用太快。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"selfEncouragement","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-28","text":"每一次回到座位，都是一次小小的抵达。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"persistence","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-29","text":"窗外有风，桌上有书，今天已经足够丰盛。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"landscape","sourceType":"original"},
  {"id":"original-30","text":"把字读清，把题看稳，余下的交给时间。","attribution":"晴笺原创","category":"reading","sourceType":"original"}
]
